WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,540
afraid

2
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:05,630
Not afraid of you

3
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:07,110
What are you afraid of?

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,100
I'm afraid that life will be too good

5
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,500
Good as a dream

6
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,890
Then make your dream come true

7
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:16,830
Brother Qin

8
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:18,670
I haven't studied much

9
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:20,030
No skills either

10
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,750
We'll have a kiss from now on

11
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:23,110
I'm afraid of dragging you down

12
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,510
You never weighed me down

13
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:29,630
In the past, no one hurt or cared about me.

14
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:31,030
It's you who cares about me

15
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:36,120
From now on, I will miss you, Xiao Xi

16
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:37,900
I don't talk empty words

17
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:40,100
I will build a good house

18
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,340
Carry the betrothal gift

19
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:43,550
Pin you down according to the rules

20
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:45,850
Let’s have dinner together later

21
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:47,660
Bear the hardship together

22
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:53,780
We have a good life together, I believe in you

23
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,140
This is what I asked Grandpa Sun to teach me.

24
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:00,090
It’s not a betrothal gift yet
